{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfs1gJFEoEsubPqDukwFB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Issue #1146 is fixed: `get_metadata_for_wheel` no longer picks up a vendored `.dist-info/METADATA`. All 11 tests in `tests/test_pep658_support.py` pass, including 3 new regression tests.\n\n**The fix** (`src/fromager/candidate.py`)\n- The fallback path now reads the wheel filename from the URL (ignoring query strings and fragments) and builds `{name}-{version}.dist-info/METADATA` from its first two components. For example, `my_pkg-1.2.3-py3-none-any.whl` maps to `my_pkg-1.2.3.dist-info/METADATA`.\n- The name is kept as it appears in the filename, underscores included, because that is what the dist-info directory uses. I did not run it through `canonicalize_name`, which would change it.\n- The helper `_wheel_metadata_path()` raises `ValueError` if the URL isn't a wheel filename.\n- If that exact path is missing from the zip, it raises `ValueError` as before. It no longer falls back to scanning for any dist-info.\n\n**Regression tests** (`tests/test_pep658_support.py`)\n- A vendored `.dist-info` listed before the root one is ignored. The old code returned the vendored metadata here, so this test covers the reported bug.\n- The directory is derived from the URL, with the name taken from the filename.\n- A `.dist-info` nested under a subdirectory is not used, and the missing-file case raises `ValueError`.\n\n**Not done**\n- I did not run `ruff` or `mypy` on the changed files. Neither is installed in `.venv`, and the project guide says to ask before installing packages. If you want those checks run, I can install them or run them through `hatch`.\n- I did not commit anything."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1581,"cache_read_input_tokens":48778,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1581},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a9543b3f-8390-40fb-8d81-8d76633f52d1","uuid":"836fb723-b27d-44f7-899c-14d0bc660b7c","timestamp":"2026-10-09T16:54:04.427Z","request_id":"req_011Cfs1gHrRSS5bK15jj1gLM"}
